      DEP    max |grad phi|/a0 = 0.647185; the constraint is active over 0.00e+00 of the meshed volume, out to R = 0.00 kpc
      for comparison, the ALGEBRAIC law (g_N > s_sat a0) calls 1.26e-03 of the same volume saturated, out to R = 5.04 kpc
